Node ID=30 troll trade
Text=<The troll looks at you for a long moment. Something in the set of its shoulders comes down.> ...We know. We count. Was many, now is none.  <It reaches behind itself, works at something with both hands, and holds it out still warm.> Old skin. Comes off anyway. You take. We owe, and Trolls do not like to owe.
