Node ID=96 the boy
Text=<He does not pretend not to know which child.>  The small one. He came in the dark and put his hands in our ore, and not the first time, and not the first of him. Your city has eaten this rock for years and paid us in nothing.  <He shrugs, and the shrug is enormous.>  We keep him because he is what we caught.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Name your price, then.
Go to node ID=97 the price
Icon=Quest Icon

Requirement=Speech moreequal 45
Reply Text=He is a child. He was sent by men who are not children, and it is those men who owe you. Take it out of them, not out of him.
